WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:09.070
Shipping & settings: delivery zones and fees, pickup, cash on delivery, VAT and the return policy.

2
00:00:09.624 --> 00:00:17.660
Under "Delivery zones & pickup", create a zone with "Add zone", list the cities and set the fee and delivery time.

3
00:00:18.213 --> 00:00:23.200
If customers can collect, turn on "Pickup at the shop" and write the address.

4
00:00:23.746 --> 00:00:34.080
In the "Cash on delivery", "VAT" and "Order rules" boxes, set cash on delivery, VAT and the order rules; "Save" in any box saves the whole page.

5
00:00:34.633 --> 00:00:42.020
In the "Return policy" box, set the return window and the policy text; that's what the assistant tells customers.

6
00:00:42.569 --> 00:00:50.530
An address outside every zone has no delivery fee and needs it set by hand; list your main cities in the zones.
